  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UBU - ITUZE iwacu project: External evaluation : IMPACT No. : 23-0000362</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This evaluation will assess the contribution of the funds allocated to Access to Justice and to the strengthening of conflict prevention mechanisms and the evolution of related policies. It will allow donors and RCN J&lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt;D to know where to put efforts in the near future for their strategic planning. This evaluation will focus on the entire UBU-ITUZE IWACU program, implemented from 1/1/ 2019 to 30/12/2022, with a particular focus on the achievement of results according to the project&apos;s logical framework, on the relevance of strategies implemented by RCN J&lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt;D and their adaptability in case they are implemented by local implementation partners, the sustainability of the results, as well as the efficiency of the funds granted. This evaluation will be used by RCN J&lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt;D to prepare its intervention strategy, to the EKN and to the Swiss Cooperation, for the consolidation of its conflict prevention policy and will inform policies of access to justice and conflict prevention in Rwanda.  IMPACT No. : 23-0000362</narrative>
  </description>
